{"id":"senador","lemma":"senador","pos":"noun","rank":1681,"glosses":["senator"],"ipa":"/senaˈdoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"senadores","feminine":"senadora","femininePlural":"senadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-senador.wav","examples":[{"text":"Muchos senadores se opusieron.","en":"Many senators opposed it.","words":[{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"oneself"},null]},{"text":"En este país, cualquier tilingo es gobernador, diputado o senador.","en":"In this country, any fool can be a governor, a representative or a senator.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831479","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"country"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"governing"},{"g":"deputy"},{"g":"or"},null]},{"text":"El senador Hoar habló duramente contra el tratado.","en":"Senator Hoar spoke strongly against the treaty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705361","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"harshly"},{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"treaty"}]}]}